\title{Comparison with fine-lattice staggered fields}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The native cochains attach coefficients to based
cells. The fine-lattice staggered constructions below
begin with vertex fields and regroup nearby sites.
Relating the descriptions requires the site map and
the operator, as well as the coefficient algebra.}

